      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<style>.svswap{max-width:1150px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px;text-align:center;}.svswap-cap{color:#7C3AED;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;font-size:14px;margin:0 0 14px;}.svswap-title{font-size:40px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1.1;margin:0 0 44px;color:#121212;}.svswap-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:28px;}.svswap-col{text-align:center;}.svswap-emoji{font-size:26px;line-height:1;}.svswap-h{font-size:19px;font-weight:700;margin:10px 0 10px;color:#121212;}.svswap-d{font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#444;margin:0;}@media screen and (max-width:989px){.svswap-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:34px 24px;}.svswap-title{font-size:30px;}}@media screen and (max-width:600px){.svswap-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}</style><div class=\"svswap\"><p class=\"svswap-cap\">WHAT MAKES SOCIALEVIA DIFFERENT</p><h2 class=\"svswap-title\">Why Socialevia Is The Perfect Swap For Booze</h2><div class=\"svswap-grid\"><div class=\"svswap-col\"><div class=\"svswap-emoji\">😌</div><p class=\"svswap-h\">Stay Calm Without Getting Sloppy</p><p class=\"svswap-d\">Relaxed and clear-headed at the same time. You stay you the whole night.</p></div><div class=\"svswap-col\"><div class=\"svswap-emoji\">⚡</div><p class=\"svswap-h\">A Social Battery That Lasts The Whole Night</p><p class=\"svswap-d\">No fading out at hour two and no crash on the way home.</p></div><div class=\"svswap-col\"><div class=\"svswap-emoji\">🍹</div><p class=\"svswap-h\">Mixes Into Anything</p><p class=\"svswap-d\">Açaí berry flavor that works in water, juice, or sparkling soda. Your drink, your way.</p></div><div class=\"svswap-col\"><div class=\"svswap-emoji\">🌅</div><p class=\"svswap-h\">Zero Hangover</p><p class=\"svswap-d\">Wake up fine, with your morning and your whole next day still yours.</p></div></div></div>",
        "color_scheme": "scheme-7",
        "padding_top": 64,
        "padding_bottom": 64
      }
    },
    "pdp_loved": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<style>.svlbt{max-width:1150px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px;}.svlbt-title{text-align:center;font-size:38px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 44px;color:#121212;}.svlbt-grid{column-count:2;column-gap:26px;}.svlbt-card{break-inside:avoid;margin:0 0 22px;display:flex;gap:10px;}.svlbt-av{flex:0 0 40px;width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:50%;overflow:hidden;}.svlbt-av img{width:40px;height:40px;object-fit:cover;display:block;}.svlbt-content{flex:1;min-width:0;}.svlbt-bub{background:#F0F2F5;border-radius:18px;padding:12px 16px;}.svlbt-bub.blue{background:#E7F3FF;}.svlbt-name{font-weight:700;font-size:15px;margin:0 0 4px;color:#050505;}.svlbt-txt{font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.5;color:#050505;margin:0;}.svlbt-txt mark{background:#FCE96A;color:#050505;padding:0 2px;}.svlbt-meta{font-size:12px;color:#65676B;margin:6px 0 0 6px;font-weight:600;}.svlbt-meta span{margin-right:14px;}.svlbt-cta{text-align:center;margin-top:34px;}.svlbt-btn{display:inline-block;background:#7C3AED;color:#fff;font-weight:800;font-size:18px;letter-spacing:.04em;padding:20px 50px;border-radius:50px;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase;}@media screen and (max-width:749px){.svlbt-grid{column-count:1;}.svlbt-title{font-size:28px;}}</style><div class=\"svlbt\"><h2 class=\"svlbt-title\">Loved By Thousands…</h2><div class=\"svlbt-grid\"><div class=\"svlbt-card\"><div class=\"svlbt-av\"><img src=\"https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/women/65.jpg\" alt=\"Shannon Delaney Parr\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"svlbt-content\"><div class=\"svlbt-bub \"><p class=\"svlbt-name\">Shannon Delaney Parr</p><p class=\"svlbt-txt\">I was a bit skeptical, but decided to give it a try. No, it didn't make me feel \"buzzed\", BUT <mark>I felt energized, chatty, and enjoyably social!</mark> I am so pleased and happy I tried this! This will be my go-to before social events! THANK YOU 😊</p></div><div class=\"svlbt-meta\"><span>Like</span><span>Reply</span><span>Send message</span><span>Hide</span></div></div></div><div class=\"svlbt-card\"><div class=\"svlbt-av\"><img src=\"https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/women/44.jpg\" alt=\"Pam Zanin\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"svlbt-content\"><div class=\"svlbt-bub blue\"><p class=\"svlbt-name\">Pam Zanin</p><p class=\"svlbt-txt\">Im oddly surprised, this does <mark>shut off the chatter in your head</mark> and is very calming. Im only 3 days in…</p></div><div class=\"svlbt-meta\"><span>Like</span><span>Reply</span><span>Send message</span><span>Hide</span></div></div></div><div class=\"svlbt-card\"><div class=\"svlbt-av\"><img src=\"https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/men/32.jpg\" alt=\"David Stevens\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"svlbt-content\"><div class=\"svlbt-bub \"><p class=\"svlbt-name\">David Stevens</p><p class=\"svlbt-txt\">Alcohol is a thing of the past. Socialevia the social lubricant gets you <mark>super focused and you stay coherent.</mark> Last call for Socialevia!!!</p></div><div class=\"svlbt-meta\"><span>Like</span><span>Reply</span><span>Send message</span><span>Hide</span></div></div></div><div class=\"svlbt-card\"><div class=\"svlbt-av\"><img src=\"https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/men/75.jpg\" alt=\"Jack LP\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"svlbt-content\"><div class=\"svlbt-bub blue\"><p class=\"svlbt-name\">Jack LP</p><p class=\"svlbt-txt\">It gives me an amazing boost I can't explain, like a light kick with clean energy. It tastes not so great but it works.. <mark>the first 20 minutes after taking, you'll notice how crappy you feel — cause about 30 mins later you'll be feeling great.</mark></p></div><div class=\"svlbt-meta\"><span>Like</span><span>Reply</span><span>Send message</span><span>Hide</span></div></div></div><div class=\"svlbt-card\"><div class=\"svlbt-av\"><img src=\"https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/men/52.jpg\" alt=\"Rob Roberto Burgan\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"svlbt-content\"><div class=\"svlbt-bub \"><p class=\"svlbt-name\">Rob Roberto Burgan</p><p class=\"svlbt-txt\">Not going to lie, I just tried this for the first time last night. I had an event at a friend's house about an hour and a half away, starting at 7:30 PM. I put one packet in a drink about 20 minutes before I got to the party. <mark>Once I got there I just felt really loose — it was really easy to talk to everybody, easy-going conversations. I was worried I might be too talkative but I wasn't. It lasted until we left about 1 AM.</mark> I ended up having an amazing time. Well worth it!</p></div><div class=\"svlbt-meta\"><span>Like</span><span>Reply</span><span>Send message</span><span>Hide</span></div></div></div><div class=\"svlbt-card\"><div class=\"svlbt-av\"><img src=\"https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/women/12.jpg\" alt=\"Pamela N.\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"svlbt-content\"><div class=\"svlbt-bub blue\"><p class=\"svlbt-name\">Pamela N.</p><p class=\"svlbt-txt\">Hi 👋 I tried it. I have pretty awful CPTSD and social anxiety and I love it. A stick lasts me like 3 drinks because it's very sweet, but it helps it last longer. I dig it hot in a thermos and it really works. <mark>I felt happier, calmer and more confident and outgoing. Highly recommended.</mark></p></div><div class=\"svlbt-meta\"><span>Like</span><span>Reply</span><span>Send message</span><span>Hide</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"svlbt-cta\"><a href=\"/collections/all\" class=\"svlbt-btn\">Take The Edge Off →</a></div></div>",
        "color_scheme": "scheme-1",
        "padding_top": 60,
        "padding_bottom": 64
      }
