pan>Like</span><span>Reply</span><span>Send message</span><span>Hide</span></div></div></div><div class=\"svtl-item\"><div class=\"svtl-node\">📅</div><div class=\"svtl-card\"><p class=\"svtl-stage\">WEEK 1</p><h3 class=\"svtl-h\">TALKING TO PEOPLE STARTS TO FEEL GOOD</h3><p class=\"svtl-desc\"><b>Mucuna and DL-Phenylalanine</b> start building your dopamine.</p><p class=\"svtl-check\">You stop replaying conversations in your head</p><p class=\"svtl-check\">You catch yourself saying yes to plans you would have dodged</p></div></div><div class=\"svtl-c\"><div class=\"svtl-c-av\"><img src=\"https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/men/45.jpg\" alt=\"Clinton Kaley\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"svtl-c-bub \"><p class=\"svtl-c-name\">Clinton Kaley</p><p class=\"svtl-c-txt\"><mark>Was the coolest guy in the room!</mark> It really works! 😎</p><div class=\"svtl-c-meta\"><span>Like</span><span>Reply</span><span>Send message</span><span>Hide</span></div></div></div><div class=\"svtl-item\"><div class=\"svtl-node\">🗓️</div><div class=\"svtl-card\"><p class=\"svtl-stage\">MONTH 1</p><h3 class=\"svtl-h\">YOU STAY CALM WHEN THINGS GET TENSE</h3><p class=\"svtl-desc\"><b>Rhodiola</b> reaches full strength.</p><p class=\"svtl-check\">A stressful moment passes and your night keeps going</p><p class=\"svtl-check\">You still have energy when the event ends</p></div></div><div class=\"svtl-c\"><div class=\"svtl-c-av\"><img src=\"https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/men/22.jpg\" alt=\"Tim Kaiser\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"svtl-c-bub \"><p class=\"svtl-c-name\">Tim Kaiser</p><p class=\"svtl-c-txt\">I've tried it and it works for me. I'm somebody that things don't really work for, if that tells you anything.</p><div class=\"svtl-c-meta\"><span>Like</span><span>Reply</span><span>Send message</span><span>Hide</span></div></div></div><div class=\"svtl-item\"><div class=\"svtl-node\">🏆</div><div class=\"svtl-card\"><p class=\"svtl-stage\">MONTH 6</p><h3 class=\"svtl-h\">YOU LIKE BEING AROUND PEOPLE AGAIN</h3><p class=\"svtl-desc\">Six months of dopamine support adds up to this.</p><p class=\"svtl-check\">You're the one making plans now, not avoiding them</p><p class=\"svtl-check\">Friends ask what changed</p><p class=\"svtl-check\">Your spouse notices you talk more at parties</p></div></div><div class=\"svtl-c\"><div class=\"svtl-c-av\"><img src=\"https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/men/32.jpg\" alt=\"David Stevens\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"svtl-c-bub \"><p class=\"svtl-c-name\">David Stevens</p><p class=\"svtl-c-txt\">Alcohol is a thing of the past. Socialevia the social lubricant gets you <mark>super focused and you stay coherent.</mark> Last call for Socialevia!!!</p><div class=\"svtl-c-meta\"><span>Like</span><span>Reply</span><span>Send message</span><span>Hide</span></div></div></div><div class=\"svtl-item\"><div class=\"svtl-node\">🎯</div><div class=\"svtl-card\"><p class=\"svtl-stage\">MONTH 12</p><h3 class=\"svtl-h\">PARTIES, MEETINGS, &amp; FAMILY EVENTS ALL FEEL NORMAL</h3><p class=\"svtl-desc\">A year of calm nights on the books.</p><p class=\"svtl-check\">The good nights outnumber the hard ones</p><p class=\"svtl-check\">You can't remember the last time you needed a drink to enjoy people</p></div></div><div class=\"svtl-c\"><div class=\"svtl-c-av\"><img src=\"https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/men/60.jpg\" alt=\"Jared McPhillen\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"svtl-c-bub blue\"><p class=\"svtl-c-name\">Jared McPhillen</p><p class=\"svtl-c-txt\">I drank this while wearing that three wolf moon shirt, and <mark>they all just gravitated toward me. Incredible.</mark></p><div class=\"svtl-c-meta\"><span>Like</span><span>Reply</span><span>Send message</span><span>Hide</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"svtl-cta\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"svtl-btn\" onclick=\"window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'});return false;\">Take The Edge Off →</a></div></div>",
