rink.”</p><p class=\"svpr-body\">“I personally love Socialevia. Sometimes it's nice to get that ‘two beers in’ feeling without actually having to drink. It's great if you're doing dry January. NA beers are still empty calories — this beats them. Socialevia user for life!”</p><div class=\"svpr-div\"></div><p class=\"svpr-name\">Shawn O.</p><p class=\"svpr-loc\">Brighton, UK</p></div><div class=\"svpr-card\"><p class=\"svpr-stars\">★★★★★</p><p class=\"svpr-quote\">“…great effects”</p><p class=\"svpr-body\">“Great ingredients, great effects, good branding/mission — what else can you ask for?!”</p><div class=\"svpr-div\"></div><p class=\"svpr-name\">Daniel C.</p><p class=\"svpr-loc\">Leeds, UK</p></div><div class=\"svpr-card\"><p class=\"svpr-stars\">★★★★★</p><p class=\"svpr-quote\">“…gave me what I was looking for with alcohol.”</p><p class=\"svpr-body\">“I stopped drinking last year and going out was difficult. Alcohol never really opened me up or made me chatty. This stuff gave me what I was looking for with alcohol. I used it to go out to a birthday party with a bunch of people I did not know. It was great. I talked to a bunch of people and made some new friends. 10/10 would recommend.”</p><div class=\"svpr-div\"></div><p class=\"svpr-name\">Jamie M.</p><p class=\"svpr-loc\">Bristol, UK</p></div><div class=\"svpr-card\"><p class=\"svpr-stars\">★★★★★</p><p class=\"svpr-quote\">“it calms me down and puts me in a flow state where I am the most productive and calm.”</p><p class=\"svpr-body\">“It's truly a one of a kind supplement that I take at least 3 times a week. Especially when I have anxiety about going into work at the office. It calms me down and puts me in a flow state where I am the most productive and calm.”</p><div class=\"svpr-div\"></div><p class=\"svpr-name\">Dylan O.</p><p class=\"svpr-loc\">Glasgow, UK</p></div><div class=\"svpr-card\"><p class=\"svpr-stars\">★★★★★</p><p class=\"svpr-quote\">“…clearing space in my head to work through each issue in a more focused way.”</p><p class=\"svpr-body\">“It's genuinely a fantastic product. I went into it expecting as much placebo effect as anything… it is 100% not a placebo. I felt extremely calm even during the highest stress situations, clearing space in my head to work through each issue in a more focused way. I also felt no negative effects whatsoever when it wore off.”</p><div class=\"svpr-div\"></div><p class=\"svpr-name\">Michael F.</p><p class=\"svpr-loc\">Birmingham, UK</p></div><div class=\"svpr-card\"><p class=\"svpr-stars\">★★★★★</p><p class=\"svpr-quote\">“as an introvert, this helps me be more outgoing without relying on alcohol…”</p><p class=\"svpr-body\">“As an introvert, this helps me be more outgoing without relying on alcohol — but if I am needing to get work done, it gives you a level of focus without jitters. I can grind and get work done for hours. I highly recommend.”</p><div class=\"svpr-div\"></div><p class=\"svpr-name\">Drew J.</p><p class=\"svpr-loc\">London, UK</p></div><div class=\"svpr-card\"><p class=\"svpr-stars\">★★★★★</p><p class=\"svpr-quote\">“…slows everything down to the point that I feel like I have more time to think through my responses.”</p><p class=\"svpr-body\">“I have used it 9 or 10 times now, and it pretty much slows everything down to the point that I feel like I have more time to think through my responses to any given situation and less reflex to respond emotionally.”</p><div class=\"svpr-div\"></div><p class=\"svpr-name\">Nathan S.</p><p class=\"svpr-loc\">Liverpool, UK</p></div></div></div>",
