        "custom_liquid": "<style>.svfaq{max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px;}.svfaq-cap{text-align:center;color:#7C3AED;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;font-size:14px;margin:0 0 14px;}.svfaq-title{text-align:center;font-size:48px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1a1130;line-height:1.05;margin:0 0 44px;}.svfaq-item{background:#F4ECE0;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 16px;}.svfaq-item summary{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:22px 26px;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1a1130;}.svfaq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none;}.svfaq-item summary::after{content:'+';font-size:28px;font-weight:400;color:#7C3AED;line-height:1;flex:0 0 auto;}.svfaq-item[open] summary::after{content:'\\2212';}.svfaq-ans{padding:0 26px 24px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#444;}.svfaq-cta{text-align:center;margin-top:44px;}.svfaq-btn{display:inline-block;background:#7C3AED;color:#fff;font-weight:800;font-size:18px;letter-spacing:.04em;padding:20px 52px;border-radius:50px;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase;cursor:pointer;}@media screen and (max-width:749px){.svfaq-title{font-size:30px;}.svfaq-item summary{font-size:15px;padding:18px 20px;}}</style><div class=\"svfaq\"><p class=\"svfaq-cap\">Get The Clarity You're Looking For 👇</p><h2 class=\"svfaq-title\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><details class=\"svfaq-item\"><summary>Does it make you feel euphoric or high?</summary><div class=\"svfaq-ans\">No. Socialevia does not get you high, and it does not give you a buzz. It does not work the way alcohol, opioids, or THC work. You feel like yourself, just without the nervousness.</div></details><details class=\"svfaq-item\"><summary>What does it feel like?</summary><div class=\"svfaq-ans\">You feel less than you expect, and that is on purpose. You do not feel buzzed, sloppy, or altered. You feel like yourself, just without the nervousness. Customers describe it as feeling like themselves on a good day.</div></details><details class=\"svfaq-item\"><summary>I've tried supplements before. They never do anything.</summary><div class=\"svfaq-ans\">Most supplements give you one ingredient at a small dose. Socialevia gives you nine ingredients at full doses. For example, it has 1,000mg of L-Theanine, and most products use less than 200mg. Every ingredient and every dose is printed on the label, so you can check them yourself. And if it still does nothing for you, you get your money back with the 60-day guarantee.</div></details><details class=\"svfaq-item\"><summary>Is there kava or kratom in it?</summary><div class=\"svfaq-ans\">No kava, no kratom. Nine active ingredients, all printed on the label: amino acids like L-Theanine and Taurine, plant extracts like Rhodiola and Mucuna, and GABA.</div></details><details class=\"svfaq-item\"><summary>Is there caffeine in it?</summary><div class=\"svfaq-ans\">No. Socialevia has zero caffeine and no stimulants. The energy you feel comes from natural ingredients.</div></details><details class=\"svfaq-item\"><summary>Will it keep me awake if I take it at night?</summary><div class=\"svfaq-ans\">No. There is no caffeine and there are no stimulants in it, so it will not keep you up. You can take it for an evening event and go to bed at your normal time.</div></details><details class=\"svfaq-item\"><summary>How long does it last?</summary><div class=\"svfaq-ans\">One packet lasts about 3 to 4 hours. That covers most events from start to finish. It wears off on its own, and there is no crash.</div></details><details class=\"svfaq-item\"><summary>What does it taste like?</summary><div class=\"svfaq-ans\">It tastes like acai mixed berry with a slightly bitter finish. The bitterness comes from the active ingredients. They have a taste at full doses, and hiding that taste completely would mean using smaller doses. It tastes best mixed in cold water over ice. One reviewer compared it to a wine cooler.</div></details><details class=\"svfaq-item\"><summary>What do I mix it with?</summary><div class=\"svfaq-ans\">Cold water over ice works best. You can also mix it with sparkling water, lemonade, your favorite juice, or a soda. There is no wrong way to mix it. If you want it to feel like your going-out drink, pour it in a nice glass.</div></details><div class=\"svfaq-cta\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"svfaq-btn\" onclick=\"window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'});return false;\">Take The Edge Off →</a></div></div>",
